Your answers will help complete your talent profile and role readiness analysis.

Please complete it<% if (deadlineText) { %> by <%= deadlineText %><% } %>.

Start: <%= inviteUrl %>
<% if (contactEmail) { %>
If you have any questions, please contact <%= contactEmail %>.
<% } %>
Thank you for your participation.

<%= teamName || companyName || tenantName %>
